<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Your lead has been closed</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f3f5f8;">
<div style="display:none; max-height:0; max-width:0; overflow:hidden; opacity:0; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; color:#f3f5f8; mso-hide:all;">An update on your lead for {!Lead.Project__c}.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f3f5f8;">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:600px; max-width:100%; background-color:#ffffff; border:1px solid #e3e6ec; border-radius:10px;">
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#112149; padding:22px 32px; border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:15px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:3px; color:#ffffff;">JOHN KEELLS PROPERTIES</td>
<td align="right" style="font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#e3c47a;">PARTNER PORTAL</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:32px 32px 8px 32px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color:#1b1b1f;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#fdecea" style="background-color:#fdecea; border-radius:20px; padding:6px 12px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px; color:#9b2c2c;">LEAD CLOSED</td></tr></table>
<h1 style="margin:18px 0 14px 0; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:24px; line-height:30px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149;">Your lead has been closed</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:23px;">Dear {!Lead.OwnerFullName},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:23px;">Your lead <strong>{!Lead.Name}</strong> for <strong>{!Lead.Project__c}</strong> has been closed.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 14px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:23px;">The same customer was also registered for this project by another channel partner or by our Direct Sales team.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0; font-size:15px; line-height:23px;">When a customer is registered more than once for a project, the customer goes to the channel partner who completes the first site visit, or to whoever books the customer first. This has now happened on another registration, so your lead was closed.</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:8px 32px 4px 32px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#f3f8f9; border:1px solid #dfe9ec; border-radius:8px;">
<tr>
<td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px 20px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#6b6b73;">LEAD</div>
<div style="font-size:18px; line-height:26px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149; padding-top:4px; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">{!Lead.Name}</div>
</td>
<td width="50%" valign="top" style="padding:16px 20px; border-left:1px solid #dfe9ec; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#6b6b73;">PROJECT</div>
<div style="font-size:18px; line-height:26px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149; padding-top:4px; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">{!Lead.Project__c}</div>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td colspan="2" valign="top" style="padding:16px 20px; border-top:1px solid #dfe9ec; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:11px; letter-spacing:1px; color:#6b6b73;">LEAD STAGE</div>
<div style="font-size:18px; line-height:26px; font-weight:bold; color:#112149; padding-top:4px; word-break:break-word; overflow-wrap:anywhere;">{!Lead.Status}</div>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:14px 32px 30px 32px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#fbf7ee; border-left:4px solid #775918;">
<tr>
<td style="padding:14px 18px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">
<div style="font-size:12px; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:1px; color:#775918;">WHAT THIS MEANS</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#1b1b1f; padding-top:6px;">The lead stays in your Leads list on the Partner Portal with this stage, as view only, and it cannot be reopened.</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#1b1b1f; padding-top:6px;">Any site visit scheduled for this lead has been cancelled, and a site visit request still waiting for approval will not go ahead.</div>
<div style="font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:#1b1b1f; padding-top:6px;">Your other leads are not affected. If you have any questions, please contact the JKP CP team.</div>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding:20px 32px 24px 32px; border-top:1px solid #ebe9e9; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:20px; color:#6b6b73;">
Thanks,<br>
<strong style="color:#112149;">John Keells Properties</strong><br><br>
<span style="font-size:12px;">This is an automated message from the John Keells Properties Partner Portal.</span>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>